   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "## C2. Dynamic centering, version 1: each social location against its own counterfactual\n\nEvery race \u00d7 gender \u00d7 institutional-context cell gets its own difference-in-differences and pre-trend tests. No group is positioned as the norm, in the spirit of effect coding (Mayhew & Simonoff, 2015)."
  },
